<div class="av-special-heading av-m6uzta5n-ce6a2f093fcfc777ab68e58af1b5a137 av-special-heading-h1 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-2 el_before_av_hr avia-builder-el-first"><div class="av-subheading av-subheading_above"><p>Privée’s Insights</p>
</div><h1 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">An Educational Blog Exclusively for Our Clients</h1><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<div class="hr av-m6v0hhlb-d24e5089edaf4bd674cf31ed75ff90c6 hr-invisible avia-builder-el-3 el_after_av_heading el_before_av_one_full"><span class="hr-inner"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<div class="flex_column av-m6wqztut-90a652efb6b18b7e2d731934dd9f21d3 av_one_full avia-builder-el-4 el_after_av_hr el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_div"><div class="avia-image-container av-m6wqdw61-4f19d63a0272bc14608e3dec44415131 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-5 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Casa Privee medical concierge staff educate clients about the newest treatments for health and wellness." class="wp-image-1216 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1216 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="450" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/edu-blog-001.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/edu-blog-001.jpg 900w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/edu-blog-001-300x150.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/edu-blog-001-768x384.jpg 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/edu-blog-001-705x353.jpg 705w" title="Education" width="900"/></div></div></div></div><div class="flex_column av-4szipx-b4570f539f2e034f9af6a187258fcdd9 av_one_half avia-builder-el-6 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m6v0kux0-beb1d2562870fa00af54573cb20bb58b" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>At <a href="/">Casa Privée</a>, we believe that informed decision-making is the cornerstone of personal well-being. Privée is our exclusive bi-weekly communication, produced exclusively for our valued clients. Each issue will address a carefully selected medical topic, whether it is a breakthrough in research, a pressing health issue, or a breakthrough in treatment, presented in an insightful and accessible way.</p>
<p>Our goal is to distill complex medical knowledge into clear and engaging narratives that arouse curiosity and facilitate understanding. While Privée is not commercial in nature, it is designed to serve as a reliable source of education, keeping you abreast of significant advances in the world of health and medicine.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>We invite you to explore, learn and participate with us in this journey of knowledge and wellness. Welcome to Privée.</p>
<p>-Professor Dr. Bankole Johnson</p>
</blockquote>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column av-7oilx-c2b2882ac4b0e59407940ca9bd08cdb8 av_one_half avia-builder-el-8 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_hr flex_column_div column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m6wnsatg-1929ee176fa12298dd875cc2e47eaaaf" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><h2>GLP-1 Antagonists:</h2>
<h5>A Modern Medical Miracle with Caveats</h5>
<p>GLP-1 receptor agonists, originally developed for diabetes, have revolutionized weight management, offering unprecedented results in appetite suppression and metabolic regulation. Drugs such as semaglutide (Ozempic, Wegovy) and tirzepatide have shown remarkable efficacy in helping people lose substantial body weight and reduce obesity-related risks such as diabetes and heart disease. Their ability to curb cravings and regulate blood sugar has placed them at the forefront of medicine.</p>
<p>However, the rapid weight loss they induce can have unintended consequences. Many users report an altered body shape, with a disproportionate loss of fat in the face, resulting in an emaciated appearance often referred to as an “Ozempic face.” In addition, some experience loss of muscle mass, which can affect strength and long-term metabolic health. While these drugs offer transformative benefits, they are not a universal solution and must be combined with resistance training and proper nutrition to preserve lean muscle mass and overall wellness.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="hr av-m6woir3u-389582c2c65c37b433c78eae04c5a9a9 hr-custom avia-builder-el-10 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_one_full hr-center hr-icon-no"><span class="hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div>
<div class="flex_column av-2i9du-0e6c7ba7a08a60d4fe1787d50727d0a6 av_one_full avia-builder-el-11 el_after_av_hr el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m6wo7dd0-02c7cf43af1166225a6e07c5e0259294 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-12 avia-builder-el-no-sibling av-inherit-size"><div class="av-subheading av-subheading_above"><p>Introducing Two Powerful Machines</p>
</div><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Artemis T-2 and Emsculpt Neo  </h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex_column av-5a6az6-059bc7a11c93fe5b6c302584b6ea3997 av_one_half avia-builder-el-13 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m6wo8jz7-d015919d7c31ab0b5c3bcc1c8e4a4cd7" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>To address some of the challenges that come with rapid weight loss, we recommend a cutting-edge, non-invasive approach that combines two powerful technologies: the Artemis T-2 and the Emsculpt Neo.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m6woafmw-ce540e74d04e6c29cd2493a80f0bb86c" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><h4>Emsculpt Neo</h4>
<p>Emsculpt Neo uses high-intensity focused electromagnetic (HIFEM) technology to stimulate deep muscle contractions that improve strength, definition, and fat reduction. It’s like doing thousands of crunches or squats in a single session, without the physical strain on your body.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m6wntacr-62060e4683bb76d283b150a47b7c199d" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><h4>Artemis T-Shape 2</h4>
<p>The Artemis T-2 complements Emsculpt Neo by delivering targeted radio-frequency (RF) energy to tighten sagging skin and promote collagen production, improving elasticity and creating a smoother, firmer appearance.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m6wobxt1-e5981f26da48537e7f0b7bf9c557e8be" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock" itemprop="text"><p>When used together, these two technologies provide a synergistic effect. They refine body contours, tone muscles, and firm areas prone to sagging, such as the abdomen, arms, thighs, and even the face. The combination not only enhances muscle definition and skin tone but also helps counteract some of the side effects of rapid weight loss, such as loose skin and loss of muscle mass.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="flex_column av-4p9rxe-042d0f49930e7930620752d87b8566b7 av_one_half avia-builder-el-18 el_after_av_one_half el_before_av_one_full flex_column_div column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-m6woxkjg-6e6a438dc19e91117387f0f60a658e6e av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-19 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Artemis T-2 body contouring, when combined with Emsculpt NEO helps tighten skin during weightloss." class="wp-image-1211 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1211 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1024" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002.jpg 1024w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-300x300.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-80x80.jpg 80w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-768x768.jpg 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-36x36.jpg 36w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-180x180.jpg 180w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/t-scultp-002-705x705.jpg 705w" title="Artemis" width="1024"/></div></div></div></div><div class="flex_column av-348g5h-f0b9e252518b6650fff7414abfeb1e73 av_one_full avia-builder-el-20 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last first flex_column_div column-top-margin"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m6v1j2d6-16c3b197c2b59ca9880ac6a35353c8d8" itemprop="blogPost" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><h2 style="text-align: center;">A Holistic Approach to Wellness</h2>
<p style="text-align: center;">For those on GLP-1 receptor agonists, the Artemis T-2 and Emsculpt Neo offer an ideal complement to your weight-loss journey. Together, they enhance your results, ensuring a more balanced and healthier transformation. This dynamic duo helps preserve muscle mass, tighten skin, and restore a more youthful, contoured look—all without surgery or downtime.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">As a leading <a href="/">Miami concierge medical clinic</a>, we’re committed to offering solutions that enhance your wellness journey, combining medical innovation with advanced technology for results that are both effective and sustainable.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Explore the perfect balance of science, technology, and wellness with us. Let’s redefine what’s possible together.</strong></em></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="contact-us.php">Schedule a consultation with us today</a>.</p>
</div></section></div>
